{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042790/extras/1ee83b8d435b3b50690205f0672d0422.avif?t=1773790963\" width=1560 height=344 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a place where children can laugh, celebrate birthdays, and create memories that last forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The least favorite park for lawyers\u2026 yet the most unforgettable for kids!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042790/extras/05dc9cef0c4f043ad2b3d66533241195.avif?t=1773790963\" width=448 height=296 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How Did We End Up Here?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friend came to the park to celebrate a birthday\u2026 but now they are missing. You arrive after closing time, determined to uncover what happened. Along the way, you\u2019ll solve puzzles and may even encounter the guest of honor\u2026 the <i>creations</i> of the park\u2019s director</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Journey Through the park</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The park itself isn\u2019t the only place to explore! Hop on the train with our friendly staff member and ride straight to the food court!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042790/extras/90f4759f9b2b6508d28097fc7ed5c6ec.poster.avif?t=1773790963\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042790/extras/90f4759f9b2b6508d28097fc7ed5c6ec.webm?t=1773790963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Radar of Emotions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Radar of Emotions lets you capture the lingering <strong>emotions</strong> of children throughout the park and store them right in the device. <strong>With their energy</strong>, you can unlock doors, start the train, and power up the attractions. But beware: the radar sees more than you think\u2026 and it <i>never forgets</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042790/extras/59265fd3f5ea4885365496efe821209a.poster.avif?t=1773790963\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042790/extras/59265fd3f5ea4885365496efe821209a.webm?t=1773790963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every emotion brings you closer to uncovering the park\u2019s secrets..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042790/extras/4d287cd05a18c168a1abecb373acc8fb.poster.avif?t=1773790963\" width=854 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042790/extras/4d287cd05a18c168a1abecb373acc8fb.webm?t=1773790963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042790/extras/4d287cd05a18c168a1abecb373acc8fb.mp4?t=1773790963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Creations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The director\u2019s handcrafted creations celebrate birthdays alongside the children and seem like harmless, cheerful monsters! <i>Truth be told\u2026 sometimes they smell\u2026 faintly of something strange?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p cla